msgstr "参数详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:29
#: 0ebf848b1efd4d01b1d480386572dbb8 2b44f442340941bda7b454337c0f4627
#: 653336adb6fd4be6bd161f4114bd4e2b 9eea3edd329f4f8d806e1d069b39fca0
#: b41d4dac0a71447d934a4bdd3d785b17
msgid "**IMU (aka INS):**"
msgstr "**IMU（即INS）：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:31
#: 3827c6a0fc64466e88a249b46f9f248d 69e4af71f45e42068c047a3129299a60
#: 6cc53966d8b047ce82490b50bc08c7b0 98336ea9da4b4cbda8b085601daff8ef
#: e197f683a0c94018babb17bd2225483b
msgid ""
"For the best results the autopilot (and thus the IMUs) should be placed at "
"the center-of-gravity of the vehicle but if this is physically impossible "
"the offset can be partially compensated for by setting the following "
"parameters."
msgstr "为获得最佳效果，飞控（及其IMU）应放置在飞行器的重心处，但如果在物理上不可能，可以通过设置以下参数对偏移进行部分补偿。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:33
#: 2eba0015a8854c4fa69f9bd354186e5c 4e24e217ec0c4f998e66fee4d5e846d1
#: 84236b4bc7d44dfea606258165f14c6a a65ad7bb130044eab3bcfa0368b9de86
#: eca4c4e99d1e4f5b9e0a54df73daec3c
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_POS1_X <INS_POS1_X>`, :ref:`INS_POS1_Y <INS_POS1_Y>`, "
":ref:`INS_POS1_Z <INS_POS1_Z>` the first IMU's position from the vehicle's "
"center-of-gravity"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_POS1_X <INS_POS1_X>`、:ref:`INS_POS1_Y "
"<INS_POS1_Y>`、:ref:`INS_POS1_Z <INS_POS1_Z>` 第一个IMU相对飞行器重心的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:34
#: 05308abbee884a28aabbd146fbe8c38a 6cf2df5ff0b049678aa7984cd81d7998
#: 8280f268a8224b2dace9c93a014896e1 c5f38a165c4e453595317d0eaa8c4127
#: de27ec6ddfda418da8b839c9bbbec93a
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_POS2_X <INS_POS2_X>`, :ref:`INS_POS2_Y <INS_POS2_Y>`, "
":ref:`INS_POS2_Z <INS_POS2_Z>` the second IMU's position from the vehicle's "
"center-of-gravity"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_POS2_X <INS_POS2_X>`、:ref:`INS_POS2_Y "
