#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:37
#: 062ab5f9648741858aa322bafa9527a3 0c7272f8e0c54ce4adb804c511053d0f
#: 7da7a2ffbac4499b9a15812aa091a4e7 949ab6c1609a47029901c320fa220a9b
#: 9731e356c7db464daa4e653166a91613
msgid ""
"The compensation is only *partial* because ArduPilot can correct the "
"vehicle's velocity and position estimate but it does not correct the "
"acceleration estimate. For example if the autopilot was placed on the nose "
"of a vehicle and the vehicle suddenly leans back (i.e. rotates so that its "
"nose points up) with no offset compensation the vehicle velocity estimate "
"would momentarily show the vehicle is climbing when it's not.  With the "
"position offsets added the velocity would not show this momentary climb.  "
"The EKF would still show a momentary vertical acceleration and because we "
"use the acceleration in our altitude hold controllers this could still lead "
"to the vehicle momentary reducing throttle."
msgstr ""
"该补偿仅是 *部分* "
"的，因为ArduPilot可以校正飞行器的速度和位置估计，但不能校正加速度估计。例如，如果飞控安装在飞行器机头，当飞行器突然向后倾斜（即旋转使机头朝上）时，没有偏移补偿的情况下，飞行器速度估计会暂时显示飞行器在爬升（实际上没有）。加入位置偏移后，速度将不显示这种瞬时爬升。EKF仍会显示瞬时垂直加速度，由于我们在高度保持控制器中使用加速度，这仍可能导致飞行器暂时减小油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:42
#: 4f1a8d63d94140eda93b2c2eb5f03f8a 61b0f5b92e22452193afb979df7326e9
