msgid ""
"Although individual position offsets can be set for each IMU, the difference"
" between the placement of IMUs on most autopilot boards is so small that the"
" same values can be used for all IMUs"
msgstr "虽然可以为每个IMU设置单独的位置偏移，但大多数飞控板上IMU之间的距离如此之小，以至于所有IMU可以使用相同的值。"

